{"page":20144,"part":1,"text":"位置\n\n\n位置\n\n假如立人、挑土、“田”、“王”、“衣”、“示”，一切偏旁皆须令狭长，则右有余地矣。在右者亦然，不可太密、太巧。太密、太巧者，是唐人之病也。假如“口”字，在左者皆须与上齐，“呜”、“呼”、“喉”、“咙”等字是也；在右者皆须与下齐，“和”、“扣”等是也。又如“宀”须令复其下，“走”、“辵”皆须能承其上。审量其轻重，使相负荷，计其大小，使相副称为善。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20144,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"fa3128ebc2d37d8a4b435afda347286393aafb0eef3186d0e38a575ca3a50383","textSha256":"fa3128ebc2d37d8a4b435afda347286393aafb0eef3186d0e38a575ca3a50383","fileSha256":"fa3128ebc2d37d8a4b435afda347286393aafb0eef3186d0e38a575ca3a50383","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20144-work-119.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"续书谱 · 位置","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/kFfK8Dci4xmDsTtkMbtjRq","originalPages":[404],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":3,"sourceTextSha256":"18b039e16aa8c18e07aa2cf0bd38e656b664558f5b717a959f5389b41a28c327","id":"local-404-18-27","page_id":404,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":18,"rawEnd":27,"reviewedTextSha256":"246c83d85910a74b909fa585c6b16d1809989c4b06b42601c3519e3f20a6e135","displayUnitOrigins":[[24,25],[25,26],[26,27]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":404,"part":2,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"郑雨荻","verifiedAt":"2026-10-19T14:14:54.393Z","revision":"246c83d85910a74b909fa585c6b16d1809989c4b06b42601c3519e3f20a6e135","textSha256":"246c83d85910a74b909fa585c6b16d1809989c4b06b42601c3519e3f20a6e135","fileSha256":"a7959b8ad3ac4b1328d4afcc5960761834bc9dbc83e2ea2d0c51808b9658a61c","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-初筛进度备份.json"}},{"start":5,"end":7,"sourceTextSha256":"1fb4d574